Subject: [PATCH] Slice 28 (catalog Slice B): tactic data model + gating engine

Registers the approved 42-tactic catalog (+3 orphan boss-puzzle tactics)
as metadata in src/data/tacticalVariations.ts: executing color, gate tier
(1 Novice club / 2 Apprentice IM / 3 Journeyman GM), parent openings
(multi-parent + sub-tactic parents), verified SAN lines. Pure gating:
a tactic unlocks when the parent variation's unmoved-piece prestige for
its executing color reaches its gate tier. 10 new tests (199 total).
